---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageMasthead from "../components/PageMasthead.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Racquet Habit"
  description="Read how Racquet Habit collects, uses, stores and shares personal information when you browse the site or place an order."
>
  <PageMasthead
    title="Privacy policy"
    intro="This notice explains the limited information used by racquethabit.com and how Fourthwall handles information when you place or manage an order."
    issue="Site policy · Effective 24 July 2026"
  />

  <article class="policy-page">
    <aside><span>Plain-language notice</span><span>Last updated 24 July 2026</span><span>Applies to racquethabit.com</span></aside>
    <div>
      <section><h2>1. Who this notice covers</h2><p>This policy covers the Racquet Habit website at racquethabit.com. Current product checkout, payment, fulfillment and order support are provided by Fourthwall under its own privacy terms. When you leave this site for Fourthwall, its notice applies to the information you provide there.</p></section>
      <section><h2>2. Information this site uses</h2><p>The site stores your display-currency preference and shopping bag in your browser’s local storage. That information stays on your device until you clear it. Google Analytics may collect information about visits and interactions, including pages viewed, approximate location, device and browser details, referral source and timestamps. The hosting provider may also process routine request information such as IP address, browser details, requested pages, timestamps and security signals to deliver and protect the site.</p></section>
      <section><h2>3. Checkout and orders</h2><p>When you proceed to checkout, the product variant IDs and quantities in your bag are passed to Fourthwall. Campaign parameters and pseudonymous analytics or advertising identifiers may also be included in the checkout link so that a visit and resulting order can be measured consistently across the two sites. Racquet Habit does not collect payment-card details on this site. Fourthwall processes order, contact, delivery, payment, tax and support information as merchant and fulfillment partner.</p></section>
      <section><h2>4. Cookies and analytics</h2><p>This site uses Google Analytics to understand aggregate site traffic, shopping interactions and completed orders. Google may set or read analytics cookies and process usage information under its own terms and privacy practices. Fourthwall may also use cookies and similar technology on its storefront and checkout. Advertising pixels are not currently enabled on racquethabit.com; this notice will be updated before any are added.</p></section>
      <section><h2>5. Sharing and retention</h2><p>Browser-local bag and currency data are not transmitted to Racquet Habit until you choose checkout, when the selected products are included in the Fourthwall checkout link. Analytics information is processed by Google, hosting security logs may be retained by the hosting provider under its operational policies, and order information is retained by Fourthwall according to its legal and service requirements.</p></section>
      <section><h2>6. Your choices</h2><p>You can remove local bag and currency data and analytics cookies by clearing site data in your browser. Browser privacy controls or content blockers may also limit analytics. For access, correction or deletion requests concerning an order, use Fourthwall order support. For questions about this site, contact Racquet Habit using the address on the contact page.</p></section>
      <section><h2>7. Changes</h2><p>Material changes will be posted here with a revised date. If new analytics, email signup or advertising tools are added, this notice will be updated when those tools are enabled.</p></section>
      <a class="paper-button" href="/contact">Privacy question <span>↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
